<title>UK: Timah at 21.975 in London at 0928 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 21.975 in London at 0928 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $21.975 per GDR in London on Monday at around 0928 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $21.975 and a high of $22.125.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Friday was $20.6000.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
